            <main id="main">
                <div class="content">
                    <article><h1>Formal Objections & W3C Council</h1>
                        
                        <nav class="toc" aria-labelledby="toc-label">
                            <h2 id="toc-label">Page contents</h2>
                            <ul id="toc" class="section-nav">
<li class="toc-entry toc-h2"><a href="#council">Cases that warrant a W3C Council</a></li>
<li class="toc-entry toc-h2"><a href="#objection-types">The Team, the W3C Council, and different types of objections</a></li>
